      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Note. Open Beta Build 1662 includes the fix https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/503009489486872583/1385032033096437900\n\n> Fixed an issue that sometimes caused travel to fail, sending you back home instead.\n\nBut the dev is \"not 100% confident in the fix.\" https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1385033444857483394 So, you guys should test it with the beta. If you still encounter, let the dev know with logs. https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1385604443285880853",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
