  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-11T07:22:23.271Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Behavior:\n\n1. Create a new world instance and attempt to join it (either by instance switching or joining a friend’s instance).\n\n2. The screen fades to black.\n\n3. The loading screen appears, showing the thumbnail of the Home world.\n\n4. The user is returned to the Home world.\n\nCurrent findings:\n\n- Changing the server region has no effect.\n\n- There is no difference between joining directly from the UI and joining via a portal.\n\n- Restarting VRChat has no effect.\n\n- Sometimes the transfer works; sometimes it doesn't.\n\n- If the Home world is set to Friend+ or similar beforehand, other users are able to join the redirected world.\n\n- This issue seems more likely to occur on the first instance switch after launching VRChat... (maybe)",
